Subtotal: $35 + 63 + 54 = 152$.

**Case $k=2$:**

$$N(8,0,8) \cdot N(0,0,0) \cdot N(2,0,2) \cdot N(0,6,6) = 1 \cdot 1 \cdot 1 \cdot 1 = 1$$

